<https://w3id.org/ontouml/knowledge#antipattern/undefformal/refactoring-2> a ok:RefactoringPlan ;
    rdfs:label "[Mod] Change stereotype:" ;
    skos:definition """[Mod] Change stereotype: this alternative should be taken if one reaches the conclusion that the relation is better qualified by another stereotype. It consists only in changing the stereotype of the relation.
 This solution is strongly discouraged if associations A and B related the same types.""" ;
