        ontouml:phaseMixin,
        ontouml:quality,
        ontouml:quantity,
        ontouml:relator,
        ontouml:role,
        ontouml:subkind,
        <https://w3id.org/ontouml/knowledge#reference/identity> ;
    ok:relation ok:Supertype ;
    ok:semanticStatus ok:DerivedFromText ;
    ok:sourceText "A «:ref:`phasemixin`» aggregate individuals that follow :ref:`different identity principles <identity>`, therefore it may not have a sortal type as ancestor. «:ref:`kind`», «:ref:`quantity`», «:ref:`collective`», «:ref:`subkind`», «:ref:`role`», «:ref:`phase`», «:ref:`relator`», «:ref:`mode`», «:ref:`quality`» are all forbidden." .

<https://w3id.org/ontouml/knowledge#constraint/phasemixin-c3> a ok:Constraint ;
    rdfs:label "PhaseMixin C3" ;
    skos:definition "A «phasemixin» is a anti-rigid construct, therefore it cannot have as descendent any rigid or semi-rigid type, as: «Kind», «Quantity», «Collective», «Subkind», «Category», «Mixin», «Relator», «Mode», «Quality»." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <urn:ontouml:source:classes/nonsortals/phasemixin/constraints.rst> ;
    ok:appliesTo ontouml:phaseMixin ;
    ok:code "C3" ;
    ok:constraintType ok:RigidityConstraint ;
    ok:modality ok:Forbidden ;
    ok:pathScope ok:DirectOrIndirect ;
    ok:references ontouml:category,
        ontouml:collective,
        ontouml:kind,
        ontouml:mixin,
        ontouml:mode,
        ontouml:phaseMixin,
        ontouml:quality,
        ontouml:quantity,
        ontouml:relator,
        ontouml:subkind,
        <https://w3id.org/ontouml/knowledge#reference/rigidity> ;
    ok:relation ok:Subtype ;
    ok:semanticStatus ok:DerivedFromText ;
    ok:sourceText "A «:ref:`phasemixin`» is a :ref:`anti-rigid <rigidity>` construct, therefore it cannot have as descendent any :ref:`rigid <rigidity>` or :ref:`semi-rigid <rigidity>` type, as: «:ref:`Kind`», «:ref:`Quantity`», «:ref:`Collective`», «:ref:`Subkind`», «:ref:`Category`», «:ref:`Mixin`», «:ref:`Relator`», «:ref:`Mode`», «:ref:`Quality`»." .

<https://w3id.org/ontouml/knowledge#constraint/phasemixin-c4> a ok:Constraint ;
    rdfs:label "PhaseMixin C4" ;
    skos:definition "A «phasemixin» should be solely dependant on intrinsic properties of its supertype, therefore it cannot have rolemixin as its supertype." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <urn:ontouml:source:classes/nonsortals/phasemixin/constraints.rst> ;
    ok:appliesTo ontouml:phaseMixin ;
    ok:code "C4" ;
    ok:modality ok:Forbidden ;
    ok:references ontouml:phaseMixin,
        ontouml:roleMixin ;
    ok:relation ok:Supertype ;
    ok:semanticStatus ok:DerivedFromText ;
    ok:sourceText "A «:ref:`phasemixin`» should be solely dependant on intrinsic properties of its supertype, therefore it cannot have  :ref:`rolemixin <rolemixin>` as its supertype." .

<https://w3id.org/ontouml/knowledge#constraint/quality-c1> a ok:Constraint ;
